  "id": "RAW_c0498981a1",
  "title": "使用 QLoRA 微调实现 JSON 提取",
  "url": "https://dev.to/jebra/fine-tuning-with-qlora-for-json-extraction-f8k",
  "date": "2026-08-11 03:51:09",
  "author": "Jebra",
  "siteName": "DEV Community: machinelearning",
  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <p>We needed to extract structured JSON from unstructured text for a domain-specific use case. We decided to train the Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct model with quantization levels of 4-bit, 8-bit and 16-bit separately.</p>\n  <p><strong>Dataset</strong>\n   <br>\n   Total samples: ~280</p>\n  <p><strong>Training</strong>\n   <br>\n   Fine-tuned using QLoRA</p>\n  <hr>\n  <h2><a name=\"evaluation-metrics\" href=\"#evaluation-metrics\"> </a> Evaluation Metrics</h2>\n  <p>We measured two scores per split:</p>\n  <ol>\n   <li><strong>Exact Match:</strong> Binary per sample (1 if all fields match exactly, else 0). Aggregated across the split.</li>\n   <li><strong>Field Match:</strong> Partial credit per sample (correct fields / total fields). Aggregated across the split.</li>\n  </ol>\n  <p><strong>Example:</strong>\n   <br></p>\n  <div class=\"highlight js-code-highlight\">\n   <pre class=\"highlight json\"><code><span class=\"err\">Gold</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"err\">JSON</span><span class=\"w\">\n\n</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\">\n  </span><span class=\"nl\">\"first_name\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"Jordan\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n  </span><span class=\"nl\">\"last_name\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"Kaur\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n  </span><span class=\"nl\">\"employment_type\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"contractor\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n  </span><span class=\"nl\">\"employer_name\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"Grounded Movement\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n  </span><span class=\"nl\">\"employer_email\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"payroll@goat.com\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n  </span><span class=\"nl\">\"employer_address_line_1\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"41 King Street\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n  </span><span class=\"nl\">\"employer_address_line_2\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"Madison, UK\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n  </span><span class=\"nl\">\"employer_registration_number\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kc\">null</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n  </span><span class=\"nl\">\"employer_tax_number\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kc\">null</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n  </span><span class=\"nl\">\"currency\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"USD\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n  </span><span class=\"nl\">\"pay_rate\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">45.0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n  </span><span class=\"nl\">\"pay_rate_basis\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"per_shift\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n  </span><span class=\"nl\">\"incentive_pay\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">5.0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n  </span><span class=\"nl\">\"incentive_type\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"per_reservation_over_n\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n  </span><span class=\"nl\">\"n\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">15</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n  </span><span class=\"nl\">\"reservation_types\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"w\">\n    </span><span class=\"s2\">\"check_ins\"</span><span class=\"w\">\n  </span><span class=\"p\">],</span><span class=\"w\">\n  </span><span class=\"nl\">\"exclude_staff_reservations\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kc\">true</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n  </span><span class=\"nl\">\"exclude_cancelled_shifts\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kc\">true</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n  </span><span class=\"nl\">\"max_pay\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kc\">null</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n  </span><span class=\"nl\">\"payment_frequency\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"weekly\"</span><span class=\"w\">\n</span><span class=\"p\">}</span><span class=\"w\">\n</span></code></pre>\n   <div class=\"highlight__panel js-actions-panel\">\n    <div class=\"highlight__panel-action js-fullscreen-code-action\">\n     <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-on\">\n      <title>Enter fullscreen mode</title> <path d=\"M16 3h6v6h-2V5h-4V3zM2 3h6v2H4v4H2V3zm18 16v-4h2v6h-6v-2h4zM4 19h4v2H2v-6h2v4z\"></path>\n     </svg>\n     <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-off\">\n      <title>Exit fullscreen mode</title> <path d=\"M18 7h4v2h-6V3h2v4zM8 9H2V7h4V3h2v6zm10 8v4h-2v-6h6v2h-4zM8 15v6H6v-4H2v-2h6z\"></path>\n     </svg>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"highlight js-code-highlight\">\n   <pre class=\"highlight json\"><code><span class=\"err\">Predicted</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"err\">JSON</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"err\">(model</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"err\">output)</span><span class=\"w\">\n\n</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\">\n  </span><span class=\"nl\">\"first_name\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"Jordan\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n  </span><span class=\"nl\">\"last_name\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"Kaur\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n  </span><span class=\"nl\">\"employment_type\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"contractor\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n</span><span class=\"err\">&gt;&gt;</span><span class=\"nl\">\"employer_name\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"Grounded\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"err\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\">\n  </span><span class=\"nl\">\"employer_email\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"payroll@goat.com\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n  </span><span class=\"nl\">\"employer_address_line_1\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"41 King Street\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n  </span><span class=\"nl\">\"employer_address_line_2\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"Madison, UK\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n  </span><span class=\"nl\">\"employer_registration_number\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kc\">null</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n  </span><span class=\"nl\">\"employer_tax_number\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kc\">null</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n  </span><span class=\"nl\">\"currency\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"USD\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n  </span><span class=\"nl\">\"pay_rate\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">45.0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n</span><span class=\"err\">&gt;&gt;</span><span class=\"nl\">\"pay_rate_basis\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kc\">null</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"err\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\">\n  </span><span class=\"nl\">\"incentive_pay\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">5.0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n  </span><span class=\"nl\">\"incentive_type\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"per_reservation_over_n\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n  </span><span class=\"nl\">\"n\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">15</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n  </span><span class=\"nl\">\"reservation_types\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"w\">\n    </span><span class=\"s2\">\"check_ins\"</span><span class=\"w\">\n  </span><span class=\"p\">],</span><span class=\"w\">\n  </span><span class=\"nl\">\"exclude_staff_reservations\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kc\">true</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n  </span><span class=\"nl\">\"exclude_cancelled_shifts\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kc\">true</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n  </span><span class=\"nl\">\"max_pay\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kc\">null</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n  </span><span class=\"nl\">\"payment_frequency\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"weekly\"</span><span class=\"w\">\n</span><span class=\"p\">}</span><span class=\"w\">\n</span></code></pre>\n   <div class=\"highlight__panel js-actions-panel\">\n    <div class=\"highlight__panel-action js-fullscreen-code-action\">\n     <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-on\">\n      <title>Enter fullscreen mode</title> <path d=\"M16 3h6v6h-2V5h-4V3zM2 3h6v2H4v4H2V3zm18 16v-4h2v6h-6v-2h4zM4 19h4v2H2v-6h2v4z\"></path>\n     </svg>\n     <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-off\">\n      <title>Exit fullscreen mode</title> <path d=\"M18 7h4v2h-6V3h2v4zM8 9H2V7h4V3h2v6zm10 8v4h-2v-6h6v2h-4zM8 15v6H6v-4H2v-2h6z\"></path>\n     </svg>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"highlight js-code-highlight\">\n   <pre class=\"highlight plaintext\"><code>Mismatch 1: \"employer_name\": \"Grounded\" (Predicted) vs \"Grounded Movement\" (Gold)\nMismatch 2: \"pay_rate_basis\": null (Predicted) vs \"per_shift\" (Gold)\n\nTotal Fields = 20\nCorrect Fields = 18\nWrong Fields = 2\n\nExact Match\nScore: 0/1\n\nField Level Match\nScore: 18/20 = 0.9  (90%)\n</code></pre>\n   <div class=\"highlight__panel js-actions-panel\">\n    <div class=\"highlight__panel-action js-fullscreen-code-action\">\n     <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-on\">\n      <title>Enter fullscreen mode</title> <path d=\"M16 3h6v6h-2V5h-4V3zM2 3h6v2H4v4H2V3zm18 16v-4h2v6h-6v-2h4zM4 19h4v2H2v-6h2v4z\"></path>\n     </svg>\n     <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-off\">\n      <title>Exit fullscreen mode</title> <path d=\"M18 7h4v2h-6V3h2v4zM8 9H2V7h4V3h2v6zm10 8v4h-2v-6h6v2h-4zM8 15v6H6v-4H2v-2h6z\"></path>\n     </svg>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <hr>\n  <h2><a name=\"results-for-16bit\" href=\"#results-for-16bit\"> </a> Results (for 16-bit)</h2>\n  <p><em>While we experimented with 4-bit, 8-bit and 16-bit QLoRA, the lower-bit experiments are omitted here for brevity.</em>\n   <br></p>\n  <div class=\"highlight js-code-highlight\">\n   <pre class=\"highlight plaintext\"><code>-------------------------------------------------------------------\nModel                    Exact Accuracy    Field Match\n-------------------------------------------------------------------\nBaseline                 0.00              0.54\nFine‑tuned               0.62              0.97\n\n</code></pre>\n   <div class=\"highlight__panel js-actions-panel\">\n    <div class=\"highlight__panel-action js-fullscreen-code-action\">\n     <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-on\">\n      <title>Enter fullscreen mode</title> <path d=\"M16 3h6v6h-2V5h-4V3zM2 3h6v2H4v4H2V3zm18 16v-4h2v6h-6v-2h4zM4 19h4v2H2v-6h2v4z\"></path>\n     </svg>\n     <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-off\">\n      <title>Exit fullscreen mode</title> <path d=\"M18 7h4v2h-6V3h2v4zM8 9H2V7h4V3h2v6zm10 8v4h-2v-6h6v2h-4zM8 15v6H6v-4H2v-2h6z\"></path>\n     </svg>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <p><a href=\"https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2F09zn8a4562fdwqxt9oms.png\" class=\"article-body-image-wrapper\"><img src=\"https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2F09zn8a4562fdwqxt9oms.png\" alt=\"Chart\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></p>\n  <hr>\n  <h2><a name=\"observations\" href=\"#observations\"> </a> Observations</h2>\n  <p>Field match improved from ~54% to ~97% after fine-tuning.\n   <br>\n   Exact match, while lower (62%), improved from 0%.</p>\n  <p>The field-level result indicates that the adapter successfully learned the correct key-to-value mapping for the majority of fields.</p>\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "一篇关于使用 QLoRA 对 Qwen2.5-1.5B 进行微调的技术案例研究，实现了结构化 JSON 提取 97% 的字段级准确率。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "一篇关于使用 QLoRA 对 Qwen2.5-1.5B 进行微调的技术案例研究，实现了结构化 JSON 提取 97% 的字段级准确率。",
  "summary": "本文记录了一个使用 QLoRA 技术对 Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct 模型进行领域专用 JSON 提取微调的实际实验。作者使用约 280 个样本的小型数据集和 QLoRA 技术，对比了基线模型与微调版本。结果显示性能显著提升：字段级匹配准确率从 54% 上升到 97%，完全匹配准确率从 0% 上升到 62%。文章强调，只要有针对性且高质量的训练数据，即使是小参数模型也能在结构化数据任务上表现出色。",
  "mainPoints": [
    {
      "point": "QLoRA 微调大幅提升了字段级提取准确率。",
      "explanation": "实验结果显示字段级匹配从 54% 提升到 97%，表明模型成功学习了特定的模式以及键到值的映射关系。"
    },
    {
      "point": "小型模型非常适合处理结构化数据任务。",
      "explanation": "使用 1.5B 参数模型证明，只要在领域数据上正确微调，大规模 LLM 并不总是特定提取任务所必需的。"
    },
    {
      "point": "评估应区分完全匹配与部分匹配。",
      "explanation": "虽然完全匹配（62%）更难实现，但字段级匹配（97%）能更准确地反映模型在真实场景中的实用价值，因为在这些场景中轻微错误可能是可以容忍的。"
    }
  ],
  "keyQuotes": [
    "微调后，字段匹配从 ~54% 提升到 ~97%。",
    "字段级结果说明，适配器成功学习了大多数字段的正确键值映射。"
  ],
